8-second NullRHI/no-audio/unattended probe. The original publication was
restored
in `finally` and the 722 MB probe tree was removed.

The runner now moves UAT `Manifest_*.txt` publication metadata and Windows PDBs
out of the candidate before atomic publication, retaining them under the target
build cache. Those metadata and symbol cache roots are preflighted as real
directories before stale cache cleanup, so redirected identities fail before
any manifest or debug-symbol file is moved. Applying that rule to the accepted
Windows
package reduced final
`dist/windows-x64` to 26 runtime/licensing files and 488,530,675 bytes. A second
